<div class="container" style="padding: 0;">
  <div class="row">
    <div class="col-lg-6">
      <div id="result" >
        <a href="<%= $SUB_DIRECTORY %>/img/sample.png" data-lightbox="sample">
          <img style="max-width:100%; max-height:100%; " alt="RSyntaxTree Sample" src="<%= $SUB_DIRECTORY %>/img/sample.png" />
        </a>
      </div>
      <div class="text-right" style="margin-top:10px; margin-bottom:10px; line-height: 100%;">
        <small>
          左クリックでズーム，右クリックで画像保存<br />
          画像エリアとテキストエリアは縦方向にサイズ変更可能
        </small>
      </div>
    </div>

    <div class="col-lg-6">
      <div id="status" style="min-height:1.5em; padding-left: 1em; margin-top: 5px; background-color: #484848	;">
        <span id="alert">
          <span class="text text-info">●</span> <span class="alertmessage"></span>
        </span>
      </div>
      <div class="anchor" id="rst-editor"></div>

      <div id="editor"><%= $SAMPLE1 %></div>

      <div class="text-right" style="margin-top:10px; margin-bottom:10px; line-height: 100%;">
        <small>
          バージョン1.0では，樹形図描画の構文が大幅に刷新されました．詳しくは<br /> <a href="https://yohasebe.github.io/rsyntaxtree/documentation_ja">使い方</a> および <a target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" href="https://yohasebe.github.io/rsyntaxtree/examples">ギャラリー</a> を参照してください．
        </small>
      </div>

      <div  class="text-right">
        <div class="row" style="margin-top:15px; margin-bottom:15px;">
          <div class="col-sm-12">
            <div style="display:inline">
              <input type="checkbox" value="" id="auto-bracket">
              <label for="auto-bracket">
                <small>括弧を自動で閉じる</small>
              </label>&nbsp;&nbsp;
            </div>
            <button type="button" class="btn btn-sm btn-light" id="check"><i class="far fa-check-square"></i><small> 括弧の対応チェック</small></button>&nbsp;
            <button type="button" class="btn btn-sm btn-light" id="clear"><i class="fas fa-eraser"></i><small> クリア</small></button>
          </div>
        </div>

        <div class="row" style="margin-bottom:15px;">
          <div class="col-sm-12">
            <button type="button" class="btn btn-sm btn-info" id="toggle-ipa-keyboard" title="クリックしてIPA音声記号パネルの表示/非表示を切り替え"><i class="fas fa-keyboard"></i> IPAキーボード</button>
          </div>
        </div>

        <div id="ipa-keyboard-panel" style="display:none; margin-bottom:15px;">
          <div class="card">
            <div class="card-body">
              <ul class="nav nav-tabs" id="ipa-tabs" role="tablist">
                <li class="nav-item">
                  <a class="nav-link active" id="markup-tab" data-toggle="tab" href="#markup" role="tab">マークアップ</a>
                </li>
                <li class="nav-item">
                  <a class="nav-link" id="vowels-tab" data-toggle="tab" href="#vowels" role="tab">母音</a>
                </li>
                <li class="nav-item">
                  <a class="nav-link" id="consonants-tab" data-toggle="tab" href="#consonants" role="tab">子音</a>
                </li>
                <li class="nav-item">
                  <a class="nav-link" id="diacritics-tab" data-toggle="tab" href="#diacritics" role="tab">補助記号</a>
                </li>
                <li class="nav-item">
                  <a class="nav-link" id="suprasegmentals-tab" data-toggle="tab" href="#suprasegmentals" role="tab">超分節音</a>
                </li>
              </ul>
              <div class="tab-content" id="ipa-tab-content" style="padding-top: 10px;">
                <div class="tab-pane fade show active" id="markup" role="tabpanel">
                  <button type="button" class="btn btn-sm btn-outline-secondary ipa-char-btn" data-char="\\" title="バックスラッシュ（エスケープ・改行）">\</button>
                  <button type="button" class="btn btn-sm btn-outline-secondary ipa-char-btn" data-char="|" title="縦線（ボックス）">|</button>
                  <button type="button" class="btn btn-sm btn-outline-secondary ipa-char-btn" data-char="*" title="イタリック・太字">*</button>
                  <button type="button" class="btn btn-sm btn-outline-secondary ipa-char-btn" data-char="_" title="下付き・上付き">_</button>
                  <button type="button" class="btn btn-sm btn-outline-secondary ipa-char-btn" data-char="^" title="三角コネクタ">^</button>
                  <button type="button" class="btn btn-sm btn-outline-secondary ipa-char-btn" data-char="#" title="括弧・矩形">#</button>
                  <button type="button" class="btn btn-sm btn-outline-secondary ipa-char-btn" data-char="{" title="丸囲み（開）">{</button>
                  <button type="button" class="btn btn-sm btn-outline-secondary ipa-char-btn" data-char="}" title="丸囲み（閉）">}</button>
                  <button type="button" class="btn btn-sm btn-outline-secondary ipa-char-btn" data-char="<>" title="空白">&lt;&gt;</button>
                  <button type="button" class="btn btn-sm btn-outline-secondary ipa-char-btn" data-char="@" title="ノード別カラー">@</button>
                </div>
                <div class="tab-pane fade" id="vowels" role="tabpanel"></div>
                <div class="tab-pane fade" id="consonants" role="tabpanel"></div>
                <div class="tab-pane fade" id="diacritics" role="tabpanel"></div>
                <div class="tab-pane fade" id="suprasegmentals" role="tabpanel"></div>
              </div>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>

        <div class="row" style="margin-bottom:15px; margin-top:15px;">
          <div class="col-sm-4">
            <button class="btn btn-sm btn-primary draw btn-block" id="draw_png" type="button"><i class="fas fa-image"></i> Draw <b>PNG</b></button>
          </div>
          <div class="col-sm-4">
            <button class="btn btn-sm btn-primary draw btn-block" id="draw_svg" type="button"><i class="fas fa-vector-square"></i> Draw <b>SVG</b></button>
          </div>
          <div class="col-sm-4">
            <button class="btn btn-sm btn-secondary draw btn-block" id="download_pdf" type="button"><i class="fas fa-file-pdf"></i> Download <b>PDF</b></button>
          </div>
        </div>

      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</div>

<div class="container" style="margin-top: 40px; padding: 0;">
  <div class="row">
    <div class="col-md-4">
      <div class="option-grid">
            <label for="tidy" title="レイアウトの尺度（広い→密の順）。Symmetric：完全な左右対称。Low：語順を厳密に保って圧縮。Medium：さらに圧縮するが語の左右順序は入れ替わらない。High：最も密（語順保証は段内のみ）">Tidy レイアウト</label>
            <select class="form-control form-control-sm" name="tidy" id="tidy">
              <option value="symmetric">Symmetric</option>
              <option value="off" selected="selected">Off</option>
              <option value="low">Low</option>
              <option value="medium">Medium</option>
              <option value="high">High</option>
            </select>
            <label for="hspacing" title="すべてのレイアウトモードで横方向の間隔を一括調整します（縦間隔の横方向版。1.0が標準）">横間隔</label>
            <select class="form-control form-control-sm" name="hspacing" id="hspacing">
              <option value="0.5">0.5</option>
              <option value="0.75">0.75</option>
              <option value="1.0" selected="selected">1.0</option>
              <option value="1.5">1.5</option>
              <option value="2.0">2.0</option>
              <option value="3.0">3.0</option>
            </select>
            <label for="vheight" title="レベル間の縦方向の距離（コネクタの高さ）です。tidy モードでは基準値として機能し、枝の角度を揃える自動加算がこれに加わります">縦間隔</label>
            <select class="form-control form-control-sm" name="vheight" id="vheight">
              <option value="0.5">0.5</option>
              <option value="1.0">1.0</option>
              <option value="1.5">1.5</option>
              <option value="2.0" selected="selected">2.0</option>
              <option value="3.0">3.0</option>
              <option value="4.0">4.0</option>
              <option value="5.0">5.0</option>
            </select>
            <label for="direction">方向</label>
            <select class="form-control form-control-sm" name="direction" id="direction">
              <option value="ttb" selected="selected">上から下</option>
              <option value="ltr">左から右</option>
            </select>
        <label for="mirror" title="樹形図全体を左右反転し、右から左に展開させます（アラビア語・ヘブライ語などRTL文字体系の慣習）">左右反転（RTL）</label>
        <div class="btn-group btn-group-sm btn-group-toggle" data-toggle="buttons">
          <label class="btn btn-light">
            <input type="radio" name="mirror" id="mirror-on" value="on" autocomplete="off"> On
          </label>
          <label class="btn btn-light active">
            <input type="radio" name="mirror" id="mirror-off" value="off" autocomplete="off" checked> Off
          </label>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
    <div class="col-md-4">
      <div class="option-grid">
            <label for="fontstyle">フォント</label>
            <select class="form-control form-control-sm" name="fontstyle" id="fontstyle">
              <option value="noto-serif">Noto Serif</option>
              <option value="noto-sans">Noto Sans</option>
              <option value="noto-sans-mono">Noto Sans Mono</option>
              <option value="cjk">WQY Zen Hei (CJK)</option>
            </select>
            <label for="fontsize">サイズ</label>
            <select class="form-control form-control-sm" name="fontsize" id="fontsize">
              <option value="6">6</option>
              <option value="8">8</option>
              <option value="10">10</option>
              <option value="12">12</option>
              <option value="14">14</option>
              <option value="16" selected="selected">16</option>
              <option value="18">18</option>
              <option value="20">20</option>
              <option value="22">22</option>
              <option value="24">24</option>
              <option value="26">26</option>
            </select>
            <label for="color">カラー</label>
            <select class="form-control form-control-sm" name="color" id="color">
              <option value="modern">Modern</option>
              <option value="traditional" selected="selected">Traditional</option>
              <option value="none">なし</option>
            </select>
        <label for="transparent">背景の透過</label>
        <div class="btn-group btn-group-sm btn-group-toggle" data-toggle="buttons">
          <label class="btn btn-light">
            <input type="radio" name="transparent" id="transparent-on" value="on" autocomplete="off"> On
          </label>
          <label class="btn btn-light active">
            <input type="radio" name="transparent" id="transparent-off" value="off" autocomplete="off" checked> Off
          </label>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
    <div class="col-md-4">
      <div class="option-grid">
            <label for="leafstyle">コネクタ形状</label>
            <select class="form-control form-control-sm" name="leafstyle" id="leafstyle">
              <option value="auto" selected="selected">自動</option>
              <option value="bar">縦線のみ</option>
              <option value="nothing">なし</option>
            </select>
            <label for="linewidth">線幅</label>
            <select class="form-control form-control-sm" name="linewidth" id="linewidth">
              <option value="1" selected="selected">1</option>
              <option value="2">2</option>
              <option value="3">3</option>
              <option value="4">4</option>
              <option value="5">5</option>
            </select>
        <label for="polyline">折れ線</label>
        <div class="btn-group btn-group-sm btn-group-toggle" data-toggle="buttons">
          <label class="btn btn-light">
            <input type="radio" name="polyline" id="polyline-on" value="on" autocomplete="off"> On
          </label>
          <label class="btn btn-light active">
            <input type="radio" name="polyline" id="polyline-off" value="off" autocomplete="off" checked> Off
          </label>
        </div>
        <label for="hide_default_connectors">コネクタを隠す</label>
        <div class="btn-group btn-group-sm btn-group-toggle" data-toggle="buttons">
          <label class="btn btn-light">
            <input type="radio" name="hide_default_connectors" id="hide_default_connectors-on" value="on" autocomplete="off"> On
          </label>
          <label class="btn btn-light active">
            <input type="radio" name="hide_default_connectors" id="hide_default_connectors-off" value="off" autocomplete="off" checked> Off
          </label>
        </div>
        <span></span>
        <button type="button" class="btn btn-sm btn-link text-muted pl-0" id="reset-settings" title="このブラウザに保存された表示設定を消去してデフォルトに戻します">設定をリセット</button>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</div>
